      "uid": "zhcn:0ac27767acc9031716f91230",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，从去年的“NHK英里C”开始，\n爱丽数码也遭遇了不少事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63c86e6ba53d71c53d10e89a5830d607462809bb01a01454ed6b45215f9dda47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
