      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”。\n在好歌剧与名将怒涛的初次对决中，\n她明白了真正的热情是什么──",
      "source_fingerprint": "31e0c2266eb8255fdf955346589d57445d87ebd2926b6be878daf3566b16584b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
