    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9591ba4e45a234e92d6e5903",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后是“英里CS”。\n体会了圣王光环身为一流的决心后，\n她的想法也有了大幅的改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa9481c5f247543a4c6cc3a19e9898b3badc0acc525ec14b1c2d949fb934edc9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
