      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而现在新的世代再度诞生──\n赛马娘们的足迹往后也会如此延续下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24b7d85024ddecdc683e86d0abb8cee89f5951cf995ba584b0b43b5351e729a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
